  "review_notes": "Free, offline-first game. No account or login is required for core gameplay. Native account/cloud and real-money purchase flows are disabled. From the title, choose BEGIN EXPEDITION, then WADDLE RUN for the avalanche chase. Swipe left/right to change lanes, up to jump, and down to slide; tap also jumps. Pause during play for Resume and Main Menu. After a run, Run Again retries. Waddle School teaches the controls. Customize lets players spend fish earned through play on cosmetics. Settings includes quality, camera shake, reduced flashing, and HUD scale. Public Leaderboard requires internet; local progress and core modes work offline. Waddle Race is not available in this release.",
